<p class="muted">The harness (<code>testing/run_tests.py</code>) is built to run every night. It doesn't run on a schedule yet: the latest results come from a manual run. "Tested ✓" means install and load only. We don't run your prompts or check each tool's output.</p>{% endif %}
<h2>4. Special cases</h2><ul>
<li><b>Grok Build + Claude Code plugins:</b> in our tests, the 12 Claude Code LSP plugins and Learn with Coursera failed to install in Grok Build, even though the docs suggest they should. xAI's docs say Grok Build reads Claude Code plugins automatically. We count that as verified from docs and flag it on each affected listing.</li>
<li><b>npm MCP packages:</b> we show commands in each agent's general MCP setup format, but we mark them not yet tested until the package's own docs confirm them.</li></ul>
<h2>5. Independence</h2><p>SkillMaxx isn't affiliated with Anthropic, OpenAI, xAI, Anysphere or Pi. Sponsored placements are labeled, limited to one per row, and never change a status.</p>
